{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 17728037534671453734,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Priority Inversion and PI Mutexes",
      "source_hash": 14736964565737501824,
      "context_hash": 3820995599162877695,
      "translation": "우선순위 역전과 PI 뮤텍스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Priority Inversion": "우선순위 역전",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680126Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The classic real-time locking problem and Linux's solution",
      "source_hash": 17919527512523615403,
      "context_hash": 8665563601554224089,
      "translation": "고전적인 실시간 락 문제와 Linux의 해결책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux's": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The priority inversion problem",
      "source_hash": 3832707366144823718,
      "context_hash": 5324845289972820582,
      "translation": "우선순위 역전 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Priority Inversion": "우선순위 역전"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Priority inversion occurs when a high-priority task is blocked waiting for a resource held by a low-priority task, and a medium-priority task prevents the low-priority task from running.",
      "source_hash": 9274528937873878867,
      "context_hash": 6909337373257690208,
      "translation": "우선순위 역전은 높은 우선순위 태스크가 낮은 우선순위 태스크가 보유한 자원을 기다리며 블록된 상태에서, 중간 우선순위 태스크가 낮은 우선순위 태스크의 실행을 막을 때 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Priority Inversion": "우선순위 역전"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Result: the high-priority task waits behind the medium-priority task indefinitely — priority is effectively inverted.",
      "source_hash": 8273135520675826047,
      "context_hash": 4851619620752262813,
      "translation": "결과적으로 높은 우선순위 태스크가 중간 우선순위 태스크 뒤에서 무기한 대기하게 되며, 사실상 우선순위가 역전됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This is not theoretical.",
      "source_hash": 356255432757990905,
      "context_hash": 16854508048270584054,
      "translation": "이는 이론에 그치는 문제가 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The Mars Pathfinder mission (1997) experienced priority inversion that caused periodic system resets until engineers uploaded a fix to enable priority inheritance on the affected mutex. ([Mike Jones, \"What Really Happened on Mars?\", 1997](https://www.cs.cornell.edu/courses/cs614/1999sp/papers/pathfinder.html))",
      "source_hash": 1706163496129080877,
      "context_hash": 7932951038972166231,
      "translation": "Mars Pathfinder 임무(1997)에서는 우선순위 역전이 발생하여 주기적인 시스템 리셋이 일어났으며, 엔지니어들이 해당 뮤텍스에 우선순위 상속을 활성화하는 수정을 업로드한 후에야 해결되었습니다. ([Mike Jones, \"What Really Happened on Mars?\", 1997](https://www.cs.cornell.edu/courses/cs614/1999sp/papers/pathfinder.html))",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Priority Inversion": "우선순위 역전",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Priority inheritance: the solution",
      "source_hash": 3093523833811085034,
      "context_hash": 8778541962684179493,
      "translation": "우선순위 상속: 해결책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When task H blocks on a mutex held by L, the kernel temporarily boosts L's priority to H's level.",
      "source_hash": 10621281220523088987,
      "context_hash": 17550184929625662357,
      "translation": "태스크 H가 L이 보유한 뮤텍스에서 블록되면, 커널은 L의 우선순위를 일시적으로 H의 수준까지 올립니다(boost).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This ensures L can preempt M and release the mutex quickly.",
      "source_hash": 2177123249729281719,
      "context_hash": 1882622660772146312,
      "translation": "이를 통해 L이 M을 선점하고 뮤텍스를 신속하게 해제할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "rt_mutex: the PI-aware lock",
      "source_hash": 2753779780187646385,
      "context_hash": 16262692392773495081,
      "translation": "rt_mutex: PI를 지원하는 락",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux provides `rt_mutex` in `kernel/locking/rtmutex.c` for PI-capable locking:",
      "source_hash": 7407911673579048196,
      "context_hash": 1249836504561344472,
      "translation": "Linux는 PI를 지원하는 락을 위해 `kernel/locking/rtmutex.c`에 `rt_mutex`를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Waiters are stored in a **priority-ordered RB-tree**, not a FIFO queue.",
      "source_hash": 14666367256019863887,
      "context_hash": 10340500843626492011,
      "translation": "대기자는 FIFO 큐가 아니라 **우선순위 순으로 정렬된 RB-tree**에 저장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FIFO": "FIFO",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The highest-priority waiter is at the root and determines the owner's boosted priority.",
      "source_hash": 2031647825706538598,
      "context_hash": 10326997030413755936,
      "translation": "가장 높은 우선순위의 대기자가 루트에 위치하며, 이 대기자가 소유자의 상승된 우선순위를 결정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Priority tracking in task_struct",
      "source_hash": 18393477460321653394,
      "context_hash": 11592798512964844405,
      "translation": "task_struct의 우선순위 추적",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`pi_waiters` is an RB-tree of tasks waiting on locks held by this task. `pi_top_task` caches the highest-priority waiter for quick access.",
      "source_hash": 17017664292633663357,
      "context_hash": 3373077077325722508,
      "translation": "`pi_waiters`는 이 태스크가 보유한 락을 기다리는 태스크들의 RB-tree입니다. `pi_top_task`는 빠른 접근을 위해 가장 높은 우선순위의 대기자를 캐시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "caches": "캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The boost mechanism",
      "source_hash": 5216593142727756234,
      "context_hash": 18417779392494798178,
      "translation": "부스트 메커니즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When task H tries to acquire a mutex held by L:",
      "source_hash": 18365704546419232674,
      "context_hash": 3388415141328460667,
      "translation": "태스크 H가 L이 보유한 뮤텍스를 획득하려 할 때:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680128Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`rt_mutex_adjust_prio_chain()` walks the lock dependency chain:",
      "source_hash": 17392698694129975452,
      "context_hash": 5558930500810612328,
      "translation": "`rt_mutex_adjust_prio_chain()`은 락 의존성 체인을 순회합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Chained priority inheritance",
      "source_hash": 12781991973528109361,
      "context_hash": 6731716485590802866,
      "translation": "연쇄 우선순위 상속",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "PI must handle chains:",
      "source_hash": 10590891926942522064,
      "context_hash": 5006505829849940761,
      "translation": "PI는 체인을 처리해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The chain walk handles this transitively.",
      "source_hash": 12251743242218878866,
      "context_hash": 7303623789937788005,
      "translation": "체인 순회는 이를 전이적으로 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel limits chain depth to prevent O(n) worst-case paths from DoS-ing the system.",
      "source_hash": 9396620738041920392,
      "context_hash": 11772173816410326022,
      "translation": "커널은 O(n) 최악의 경로가 시스템에 DoS를 일으키지 않도록 체인 깊이를 제한합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The boost application: rt_mutex_setprio()",
      "source_hash": 9650660551533366209,
      "context_hash": 8977552411681438554,
      "translation": "부스트 적용: rt_mutex_setprio()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The boosted task runs with the PI task's priority — it gets scheduled exactly as if it were that high-priority task, until it releases the lock.",
      "source_hash": 4694624790019162893,
      "context_hash": 1126785840655449622,
      "translation": "부스트된 태스크는 PI 태스크의 우선순위로 실행되며, 락을 해제할 때까지 마치 그 높은 우선순위 태스크인 것처럼 정확히 동일하게 스케줄링됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Unboost on lock release",
      "source_hash": 10085022780640268179,
      "context_hash": 13369885172539293721,
      "translation": "락 해제 시 언부스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When L releases the mutex:",
      "source_hash": 15856800305621619738,
      "context_hash": 4540126926143239156,
      "translation": "L이 뮤텍스를 해제할 때:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680129Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "L is removed from H's `pi_waiters` (or H's priority is removed from L's boost)",
      "source_hash": 10124643391665755280,
      "context_hash": 12908407305644793431,
      "translation": "L이 H의 `pi_waiters`에서 제거됩니다(또는 H의 우선순위가 L의 부스트에서 제거됩니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`rt_mutex_setprio(L, new_pi_top)` is called — where `new_pi_top` is the next-highest waiter (or NULL if none)",
      "source_hash": 9350306062015098377,
      "context_hash": 2474252825999157420,
      "translation": "`rt_mutex_setprio(L, new_pi_top)`가 호출됩니다. 여기서 `new_pi_top`은 그다음으로 높은 우선순위의 대기자입니다(없으면 NULL)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "L's priority reverts to `normal_prio`",
      "source_hash": 5132603884458692738,
      "context_hash": 17328965136279925990,
      "translation": "L의 우선순위가 `normal_prio`로 되돌아갑니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "H is woken and acquires the lock",
      "source_hash": 3941598911820359492,
      "context_hash": 1948933751024468136,
      "translation": "H가 깨어나 락을 획득합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Userspace rt_mutex: PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT",
      "source_hash": 6629870275364751820,
      "context_hash": 7850117351016851065,
      "translation": "사용자 공간 rt_mutex: PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:19.680130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The POSIX pthread mutex protocol `PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT` uses the kernel's `rt_mutex` infrastructure:",
      "source_hash": 13356186792970696378,
      "context_hash": 15793019342697936315,
      "translation": "POSIX pthread 뮤텍스 프로토콜인 `PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT`는 커널의 `rt_mutex` 인프라를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "On Linux, `PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT` mutexes are backed by a futex with the `FUTEX_LOCK_PI` operation, which in turn uses `rt_mutex` internally.",
      "source_hash": 219053030301587462,
      "context_hash": 1005232396174364083,
      "translation": "Linux에서 `PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT` 뮤텍스는 `FUTEX_LOCK_PI` 연산을 사용하는 futex를 기반으로 하며, 이 futex는 내부적으로 다시 `rt_mutex`를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "futex": "futex",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "PI mutex vs regular mutex",
      "source_hash": 427818771598263994,
      "context_hash": 8461899847153862438,
      "translation": "PI 뮤텍스와 일반 뮤텍스 비교",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Property",
      "source_hash": 12663700143509946447,
      "context_hash": 106563719220029733,
      "translation": "속성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Property": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "pthread_mutex (default)",
      "source_hash": 13255052493232099673,
      "context_hash": 9771098818406301431,
      "translation": "pthread_mutex (기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "pthread_mutex (PRIO_INHERIT)",
      "source_hash": 4030651946567075500,
      "context_hash": 1001146076594964132,
      "translation": "pthread_mutex (PRIO_INHERIT)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Lock owner boost",
      "source_hash": 5702871275066955413,
      "context_hash": 8326417898444144333,
      "translation": "락 소유자 부스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "No",
      "source_hash": 3846534607940335394,
      "context_hash": 12544310209918067793,
      "translation": "아니요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "No": "아니요"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Yes",
      "source_hash": 3389992145996609386,
      "context_hash": 16907894543345685493,
      "translation": "예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Yes": "예"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:7/seg:0",
