      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "futex (FUTEX_LOCK)",
      "source_hash": 16841016114623661045,
      "context_hash": 16149252548854199844,
      "translation": "futex (FUTEX_LOCK)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "futex": "futex"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "futex (FUTEX_LOCK_PI / rt_mutex)",
      "source_hash": 11605665438752476505,
      "context_hash": 13028269910029780881,
      "translation": "futex (FUTEX_LOCK_PI / rt_mutex)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "futex": "futex"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "For pure RT applications where all threads are the same priority, regular mutexes are fine.",
      "source_hash": 9756051614501796092,
      "context_hash": 6499094216327685495,
      "translation": "모든 스레드의 우선순위가 같은 순수 RT 애플리케이션에서는 일반 뮤텍스로 충분합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "PI mutexes are needed when RT tasks share resources with non-RT tasks.",
      "source_hash": 12635893427280113913,
      "context_hash": 1780730920796948155,
      "translation": "RT 태스크가 비 RT 태스크와 자원을 공유할 때는 PI 뮤텍스가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SCHED_DEADLINE and PI",
      "source_hash": 8105207743029357653,
      "context_hash": 2708711891666428996,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE과 PI",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`SCHED_DEADLINE` tasks can also experience priority inversion.",
      "source_hash": 6646523366628854922,
      "context_hash": 17464373510860309613,
      "translation": "`SCHED_DEADLINE` 태스크도 우선순위 역전을 겪을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Priority Inversion": "우선순위 역전"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When a DL task blocks on an rt_mutex held by a normal or RT task, the owner is boosted to run with a virtual DL entity borrowed from the DL task:",
      "source_hash": 3825994311077369161,
      "context_hash": 6887806158597831913,
      "translation": "DL 태스크가 일반 태스크나 RT 태스크가 보유한 rt_mutex에서 블록되면, 소유자는 DL 태스크에게서 빌려 온 가상 DL 엔티티로 실행되도록 부스트됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The boosted task temporarily runs under SCHED_DEADLINE semantics, ensuring it can preempt any RT task and release the lock before the DL task's deadline.",
      "source_hash": 16657156761687672100,
      "context_hash": 2887133778357776439,
      "translation": "부스트된 태스크는 일시적으로 SCHED_DEADLINE 시맨틱으로 실행되므로, 어떤 RT 태스크든 선점할 수 있고 DL 태스크의 데드라인 이전에 락을 해제할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The PREEMPT_RT extension",
      "source_hash": 7673164818914297908,
      "context_hash": 2687892605503567674,
      "translation": "PREEMPT_RT 확장",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The full `PREEMPT_RT` patchset converts most kernel spinlocks to rt_mutexes, extending PI to nearly all kernel locking.",
      "source_hash": 3228864737142872434,
      "context_hash": 13633864571423191815,
      "translation": "전체 `PREEMPT_RT` 패치셋은 대부분의 커널 스핀락을 rt_mutex로 변환하여, PI를 거의 모든 커널 락킹으로 확장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "spinlock": "스핀락"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This allows full preemption of kernel code and eliminates most sources of unbounded latency — at the cost of more complex locking and slightly higher overhead.",
      "source_hash": 15763022173734811237,
      "context_hash": 4970361958615216347,
      "translation": "이를 통해 커널 코드의 완전한 선점이 가능해지고 제한 없는 지연 시간의 원인 대부분이 제거되지만, 그 대가로 락킹이 더 복잡해지고 오버헤드가 약간 높아집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "overhead": "오버헤드",
        "preemption": "선점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As of kernel 6.x, large parts of PREEMPT_RT are upstream. `CONFIG_PREEMPT_RT` can be selected on supported architectures.",
      "source_hash": 9731144706858138942,
      "context_hash": 912485612948030838,
      "translation": "커널 6.x 기준으로 PREEMPT_RT의 상당 부분이 업스트림에 반영되어 있습니다. 지원되는 아키텍처에서는 `CONFIG_PREEMPT_RT`를 선택할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "upstream": "업스트림"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:24.448150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
